<title>HONG KONG: Dragonair on Internet.</title>
<headline>Dragonair on Internet.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong Dragon Airlines Limited (Dragonair) has succesfully launched its own web site on the Internet, an airline spokeswoman told Reuters.</p>
<p>But she said the airline has no firm plans yet to allow bookings and ticket purchases.</p>
<p>Dragonair's website address at: http://www.dragonair.com includes airline information such as cargo services, destinations and flight schedules.</p>
<p>China National Aviation Corp holds about 36 percent of Dragonair, while Swire Pacific and Cathay Pacific Ltd together hold about 26 percent. --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44-171-542-7706 Fax+ 44-171-542-5017</p>
